<item name='OriginalModTime'><datetime dst='true'>20090806T115509,57-04</datetime></item>
<item name='HFText'><text>No</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>2. Database Custodian Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>2. Guide de gardien de base de données</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>4</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>2</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='73%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>There are three keyword documents that allow you to customize the Orders application.  These documents are titled </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>DefaultBillTo, RefNumberPrefix, </run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>and </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>SendToAdmin.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	-</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>(NEW added to the August 2009 release) The </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Currency </run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>documents are a list of available Currency to select on the Order form.  It is no longer possible to enter currency manually as this was causing data quality issues.</run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.1000in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='1in'/>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>- The </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>DefaultBillTo</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> document will determine who's name goes into the "Bill To" field of the order form by default.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>- The </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>RefNumberPrefix</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> lets you customize the prefix shown on your reference number.  This can be any text string.  Please note that any changes to the RefNumberPrefix document will only appear in new documents.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>- The </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>SendToAdmin </run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>document will determine who receives email when someone clicks the "Send To Admin" button from the order form.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='3'/>
