<pardef id='4' leftmargin='0.8118in' spaceafter='1.5'/>
<par def='4'><run><font size='9pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Open the document you wish to modify, and change the value of the English field.  Any changes you make will alter the default Bill To name, Reference Number, and Admin Person for all new orders.  Old orders will retain the previous values.</run></par>
<pardef id='5' leftmargin='1.2500in' firstlineleftmargin='1in' spaceafter='1.5'/>
<par def='5'><run><font size='9pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>N.B. If you change the name of the Admin Person be sure to press the "Update Order Forms" button on the action bar after closing the edit window.</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font size='9pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20' color='red'/>DO NOT CHANGE THE LOOKUP TYPE!  </run><run
><font size='9pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>The Lookup Type </run><run
><font size='9pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>must</run><run><font size='9pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/> be exactly as entered.  There should only be one document of each type in the view.</run></par>
